  "description": {
    "en": "Tecnifibre TGV is a premium multifilament string designed around two priorities: exceptional comfort and increased durability. Constructed with more than 1,200 polyamide microfilaments and a very high proportion of PU400 polyurethane, it delivers a soft, highly elastic response while improving resistance compared with traditional multifilaments. SPL surface treatment reduces friction and improves snap-back. Available in 1.25, 1.30 and 1.35 mm gauges, players can choose between maximum power and comfort, balanced performance, or maximum durability.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre TGV 是一款以舒适性与耐久性为核心的高端多芯球线。采用超过1200根聚酰胺微纤维，并含有非常高比例的 PU400 聚氨酯，因此能够提供极其柔和、富有弹性的击球反馈，同时相比传统多芯线拥有更好的耐久表现。SPL 表面处理可降低摩擦并帮助球线快速回位。提供1.25、1.30和1.35毫米三种线径：1.25偏最大力量与舒适，1.30最均衡，1.35则偏最大耐久。"
  },

